01:39:32.446 --> 01:39:35.608
He married a gypsy woman and travels the world in a caravan.

01:39:36.829 --> 01:39:39.631
Chaplin also organized large banquets with visiting friends.

01:39:40.292 --> 01:39:41.212
Hollywood veterans,

01:39:41.873 --> 01:39:43.094
stars from all over Europe.

01:39:44.655 --> 01:39:47.437
He finally gives the impression of letting life happen.

01:39:52.154 --> 01:39:54.556
He was very bitter about the United States,

01:39:54.997 --> 01:39:59.601
But he was happy to be living in Switzerland with Una and the children in a very beautiful house.

01:40:01.203 --> 01:40:01.924
They were free.

01:40:02.604 --> 01:40:03.825
They have travelled a lot.

01:40:04.586 --> 01:40:05.988
Their lives were very full.

01:40:09.811 --> 01:40:13.655
He became a bon vivant, and I think that was true throughout his life before that.

01:40:13.755 --> 01:40:14.756
It was really the job.

01:40:15.969 --> 01:40:20.890
This film industry and all the worries about continuing,

01:40:21.631 --> 01:40:22.951
to produce something,

01:40:23.411 --> 01:40:26.692
He discovered life from a slightly different perspective.

01:40:27.752 --> 01:40:29.193
And I think it did him a lot of good.

01:40:29.273 --> 01:40:30.873
I think he was very happy.

01:40:31.873 --> 01:40:32.934
And the family is growing.

01:40:33.694 --> 01:40:34.194
In total,

01:40:34.414 --> 01:40:35.935
