01:40:40.436 --> 01:40:41.136
But deep down,

01:40:42.116 --> 01:40:44.297
Chaplin suffers from no longer being the man he once was.

01:40:45.325 --> 01:40:48.926
He misses cinema and is gradually getting back to work.

01:40:51.067 --> 01:40:53.887
He was very afraid of being forgotten by the public.

01:40:54.268 --> 01:40:55.708
that people are no longer interested in him,

01:40:56.868 --> 01:40:58.229
that he is a has-been,

01:40:58.669 --> 01:40:59.169
