Yes,
a child who was running down the stairs a little.

01:43:40.759 --> 01:43:41.539
Too loudly,

01:43:41.619 --> 01:43:42.119
Well then,

01:43:43.380 --> 01:43:49.164
It was the severe and rigid side that stood out in the old Victorian man.

01:43:51.385 --> 01:43:54.086
Everyone around him understood that he needed to be left alone.

01:43:54.927 --> 01:43:55.467
Music,

01:43:56.127 --> 01:43:56.768
