01:45:07.967 --> 01:45:11.609
But Chaplin will also teach them the art of disguise and comedy.

01:45:26.115 --> 01:45:28.856
I feel nostalgic for that childhood that I adored.

01:45:29.116 --> 01:45:33.478
I regret not being a teenager or a child anymore.

01:45:34.719 --> 01:45:35.619
Over the years...

01:45:36.583 --> 01:45:39.264
They will all leave the manor to live their lives.

01:45:40.464 --> 01:45:42.665
